Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.36,0:00:03.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.35,0:00:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了我 又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就决定骗我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You decide to trick me into being possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.97,0:00:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让一个疯子天使附身吗 看看都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}By some psycho angel. And now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin的死都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's blood is on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll find Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后亲手结果了那个混蛋 但我要一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll end that son of a bitch.But I'll do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that supposed to mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 跟我有关的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, people get close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,都被杀害了 有的情况更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gey killed or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.89,0:00:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会拦着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是Cain之印\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bloody Mark of Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.21,0:00:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,标记和初刃是相辅相成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark and the Blade work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这真的是你想要的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you the mark, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以把标记传给你 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's what you truly want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,标记是可以转移给其他人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark can be transferred.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.89,0:00:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打给了一个朋友 Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called a friend of ours, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.73,0:00:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟我们是同行 做事情很独特\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does what we do, in his own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再犯傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop being an idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.15,0:00:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这样做的后果是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you know what's coming next, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,大丹麦狗马默杜克 你真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Marmaduke, you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.29,0:00:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,去查案子了 也可能去看牙医了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On a case…or the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我不知道 我很久没跟他联系过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I don't know, I haven't heard from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.95,0:00:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth他人还是没有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth still MIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:54.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格兰茨堡 威斯康辛州）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:51.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格兰茨堡纪念医院）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.46,0:01:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在找人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for a John Doe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.01,0:01:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是几天前住的院\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was admitted here a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:01:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.61,0:02:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,瘦 长得跟Ichabod Crane似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinny, Ichabod Crane, looking kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你说的是谁了 113号房 探员先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know just who you mean.Room 113, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.91,0:02:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.41,0:02:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两天找他的人还挺多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure is a popular fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我监听了警察内线 发现Garth就是那个无名氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw Garth's John Doe on the police wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.79,0:02:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.73,0:02:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪儿赶过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.72,0:02:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,新墨西哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Mexico.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.90,0:02:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,长途跋涉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,考虑到我一个人就能处理好这事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially considering that I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想走人的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much covered, so if you wanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他谈过了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spoken to him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.31,0:02:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他注射了止痛剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assload of painkillers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来的时候他就睡着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been out since I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他犯了什么事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he being charged with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了一头牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正打算看看能问出什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was about to see if I could find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.66,0:03:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 肾上腺素\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?Adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.66,0:03:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想把他叫醒 还是想杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you trying to jump-start him or kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想要一个答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.49,0:03:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他背弃了Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}He walked out on Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,背弃了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He walked out on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你有更好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.09,0:03:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.89,0:03:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪里 医院吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?A hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.51,0:03:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我上天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别紧张 Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take it easy, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿是威斯康辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被一辆车撞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hit by a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 呃 很模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-uh…vaguely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,手铐是怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the hardware.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想问你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你在这里 为什么不说说你擅离职守的\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you're at it.Why don't you give us some lowdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个月里 跑去哪里快活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On why you went AWOL for the past six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是知道了你杀了一头牛之后才找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only way we tracked you down is that you offed a cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offed a what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我当时在查一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I was on a hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt for what.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 哦不 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…oh no, I'll get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真庆幸我没有给他注射肾上腺素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing I didn't give him the adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gadreel的事儿有什么进展吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything on Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 还真有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发现他在逃跑之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out that he left some grace in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我体内留下了一部分荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he bolted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白这听起来情况很不妙 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how wrong that sounds, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心 Cass都治疗得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't worry about it.Cass took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 只是我刚走了俩星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, I'm gone for two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.22,0:05:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉你好像跟少年妈妈一样糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're like an episode of Teen Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.32,0:05:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸 Garth 吐完就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just breathe, Garth, work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胳膊那儿怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.95,0:05:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是Cain送的小礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gift from Cain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 摔跤选手那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like…the wrestler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒希望是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样就帅多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 一个旧约里的老头子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.The Old Testament dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.88,0:05:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩看对了眼 然后他就把他的烙印传给我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got biblical on me and gave me his mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底什么意思 为什么会发生这种事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does this even mean.How did that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Crowley和我找到了他 他把烙印传给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley and I found him and he gave me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就能永远解决掉Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that I can 86 Abaddon once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟Crowley一起查案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worked a job with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你认识的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.45,0:06:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他个小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth怎么能从我们眼皮子底下溜掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would Garth run from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过去6个月为什么没有一点儿音讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven't we hear from him for the last six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你测试过他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you test him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.66,0:06:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正昏迷着 我当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was unconscious, no.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.49,0:06:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他偷了辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}He steal a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.49,0:06:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是光着身子偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he steal a car naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.48,0:06:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看这些摄像头拍到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I could find on those cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以去跟那个叫Brown的农场主谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go talk to farmer Brown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.82,0:06:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 问问那头牛的事儿 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See about that cow - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上周 死的是几只鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last week, it was a couple of chickens.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.45,0:06:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上上周 是羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goat, the week before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看见那男孩子从我的谷仓里跑出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when I saw that boy tearing out of my barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.78,0:06:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我肯定得先抄家伙上啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell yeah I was gonna ask questions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些动物都是死于相同的手法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the animals were they all killed in the same manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,更像是献祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean by that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的内脏都被挖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their organs was ripped clean out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.90,0:06:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这不是什么恶魔崇拜之类的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this wasn't some kind of devil-worship thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那头牛不仅仅是被杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the cow wasn't just killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.16,0:07:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还被挖走了内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was eviscerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth为什么在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was Garth there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.60,0:07:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他在查案子 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was on a hunt, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定他就是在追杀牛的罪魁祸首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's hunting whatever killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.65,0:07:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他看见咱俩为什么要跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿绝对不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing's starting to stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.01,0:07:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定能看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.69,0:07:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, any luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.25,0:07:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视器拍摄的角度不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cameras were pointing in the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒希望是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.92,0:07:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 - 既然Garth是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So - So, Garth's a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不想被人找到的时候 谁都找不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he wants to stay gone, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.11,0:07:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走进了死胡同\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.07,0:07:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还能怎么说呢 Sammy\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what can I say, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.41,0:07:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿咱们管不了 别忘了给我寄明信片\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost this one.Send me a postcard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 车子形状 型号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, make, model.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有车牌号都照到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}License plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说过我们不能再在一起查案子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we can't hunt together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我弄清楚Garth到底在搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And after we find Garth and get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:07:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在此之前 别再跟我耍小花招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But until then, no more games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那车的主人是个叫Bess Meyers的女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ride belongs to a girl named Bess Meyers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她家就在旁边的镇子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lives in the next town over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.70,0:08:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.29,0:08:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.16,0:08:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很好 只是有点儿小误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's cool.Just a simple misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在跟谁说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you talking to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}What what girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.95,0:08:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩 大家都冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, everyone needs to take a chill pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把枪放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And put their guns down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么人都没有吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们现在表现得成熟一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's all be grown-ups here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来场大人之间的谈话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have an adult conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 求你了 别伤害她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, please, don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:08:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.48,0:09:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.19,0:09:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样按住你的伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这儿干什么 Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing here, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.03,0:09:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是朋友 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're friends, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,可他们是猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 大家初次见面 产生了不小的误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we've all gotten off on the wrong foot here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们再来重新认识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's do things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这是Bess\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, this is Bess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.95,0:09:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My beloved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.50,0:09:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bess 这是Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Bess, that's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.82,0:09:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然他现在火气大到能对着一屋子空气打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, he could start a fight in an empty house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But deep down inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.20,0:09:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个大号泰迪熊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just a big old Teddy bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边这位是Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sam here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.04,0:09:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam有的时候可能会变得危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam can be a bit insecure at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.61,0:09:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那都是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝保佑他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得真好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 伙计们 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.09,0:09:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,6个月以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 6 months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在缅因州 波特兰市外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was outside Portland, Maine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.25,0:09:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,追捕一只狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting this big bad wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它干掉了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took him down, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他咬了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bit me in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.36,0:10:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么就没想着给我们打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't call one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后告诉你们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你们我搞砸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我知道这种事情的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I knew the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能有解药 所以我只能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no cure, so I accepted my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃了我最喜欢的芙蓉蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ate my favourite dish of egg fu yung.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看了全宇宙最棒的电影洛奇3 然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watched the world's greatest movie Rocky III.And then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.36,0:10:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 我做好了上路的准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was ready to eat a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那时 Bess找到了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Bess here found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.70,0:10:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how'd she do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到了他 不然呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smelled him.How else.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.31,0:10:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说服我把枪从嘴里拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She talked the gun out of my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.64,0:10:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就想人们说的那样 过去的就过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as they say, the rest is history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.59,0:10:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经结婚4个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been married for 4 months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're married.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.28,0:10:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟一只狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.52,0:10:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的族人接受他作为其中一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my pack has taken him in as one of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.27,0:10:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 这跟你们想的不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, it's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从不伤害人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不 你们只对着牛才会热血喷张\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you just go all Wolverine on cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他没有吃人类的心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least he's not eating human hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道对于一个像Garth一样被咬的狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how hard it is for a bitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制住自己的本能是多么困难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To control his instincts like Garth does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在做的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}How well he's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.38,0:11:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事实 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's the truth, honey bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.77,0:11:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 被咬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, a…a bitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.46,0:11:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是被咬的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all bitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.72,0:11:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以是天生狼人 像我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're either born to it, like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是被咬而变成狼人 像Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you're bitten like Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.03,0:11:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你一出生就是狼人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you're-you're born a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是第二代\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.09,0:11:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth 我们可以和你谈谈吗 单独的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth, can we talk to you for a sec, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.87,0:11:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你去找找药膏擦擦手臂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, why don't you to find some ointment for that arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们想要先动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know you guys want to shoot first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,再问问题 但是我已经四处查看过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ask questions later, but I checked everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pack is clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's Kosher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.07,0:11:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 除了你妻子袭击我那一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, minus the part where your wife attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 因为你俩闯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because you two came busting in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像房子着火了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a house on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着枪乱指 这下巴 这发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guns waving, the jawlines and the hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.10,0:11:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在是太吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very intimidating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:11:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能预料到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 没人想要惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, no one wants any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.46,0:12:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my word on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我已经不相信你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.That ship has sailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要更多的线索 不止是你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need a hell of a lot more than your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.64,0:12:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 行 告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Okay.Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来跟我们一起祈祷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come pray with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 刚停好车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, just pulled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时还是一知半解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing too sketchy yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.91,0:12:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好事 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good thing, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.63,0:12:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别希望太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not betting on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.07,0:12:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我们都如此悲观了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are we just that jaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 或许Garth是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe Garth's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是瞎了眼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, ain't you a glass half full.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察那里有线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any luck with the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长等下就会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff should be rolling up any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在第二节要唱得重一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to come in strong on the second verse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.72,0:12:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.24,0:12:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth 从这里开始弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth, play it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.18,0:13:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Joy Garth的岳母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Joy, Garth's mother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.37,0:13:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,继岳母才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, stepmother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我觉得听起来很傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I always thought sounded so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.55,0:13:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.55,0:13:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just finishing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你直接跟Garth说我来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just tell Garth I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.81,0:13:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这里 你是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're safe under my roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样我也想问同一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only ask the same in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.92,0:13:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是那个带着银子弹的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the one carrying silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.66,0:14:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you brother Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美的伴奏 一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful accompaniment, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在教堂里再见吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll see the rest of you in the pews.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.52,0:14:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点整\N{\fnArial\fs30}9 am, sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能迟到哦 Amelia\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stragglers, sister Amelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.19,0:14:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你说什么呢 一切都正常 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what'd I tell you, it's all good, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.69,0:14:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人都是狼人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone here's a wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.20,0:14:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吗 那就不怎么好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, not all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别闹别扭了 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.23,0:14:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要来见见大家伙儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.49,0:14:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是Russ和Joba\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Russ and Joba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bess在Joy家的表兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bess' first cousins on sister Joy's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.08,0:14:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位是Jim神父 Bess的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's reverend Jim, Bess' dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时也是狼群的首领 他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leader of the pack and a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.97,0:14:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是Dean对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.15,0:14:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Jim Meyers 但大家一般都叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim Meyers, folks usually call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim神父 我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverend Jim, yeah, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太冒失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.61,0:14:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean他有严重的洁癖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's got this crazy fear of germs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你的顾虑 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your apprehension, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎人和我们一族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters and our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来就没有什么好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have the best history together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.78,0:15:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想你会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think you'll find.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.15,0:15:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我们并没有什么区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not much different from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 教友 对于这点我非常怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sister, I highly doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如留下来跟我们一起吃个饭吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we break bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.15,0:15:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家开动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, everybody eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.72,0:15:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了留点儿肚子吃派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you leave room for pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Joy做的派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Joy's pies are famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是威斯康辛一绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throughout the badger state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean最爱吃派了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean loves pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不说点儿餐前祷告语什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you guys say some sort of a grace or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.28,0:16:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,相对于宗教 我们更信仰精神的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're more spiritual than we are religious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的信仰 和美国印第安人差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe, much like the American Indians did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天人合一\N{\fnArial\fs30}That nature and man are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.18,0:16:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他们确实干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, really worked out well for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.15,0:16:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们这群狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are a bunch of werewolves wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,都把银子弹戴在脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver bullets around their necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.77,0:16:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 不好意思 我们不用W开头的那个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Dean, but we don't use the W word around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们更倾向于于变狼患者这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}We prefer the term lycanthrope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有权表达自己的观点 Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is entitled to his opinion, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.11,0:16:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们种族的许多人认为自己是坚不可摧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of our kind see themselves as indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗子弹能够时常提醒我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a constant reminder of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要好好珍惜我们现在的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}How precious our lives truly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.95,0:16:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 但是那是银制的 不会烧伤自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but it's silver, I mean, doesn't it burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it does a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这才是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's kind of the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们记住自己的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It reminds us of our fragility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.33,0:16:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿 Bess 天生就是狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter, Bess, was born a lycanthrope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.84,0:16:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那曾是我最骄傲的一段日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's one of the proudest days of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当猎人杀死了我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which soon turned tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切瞬间成了悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}When a hunter killed my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我说我要那个人付出代价的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me when I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.20,0:17:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to make someone pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来我看到了Bess\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I looked at Bess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,才明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I realized the road to revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.47,0:17:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,复仇之路是如此黑暗和孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is a dark and lonely one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.78,0:17:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会永远摆脱不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you never get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就在你心里留下烙印\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that hole in the pit of you stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.58,0:17:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都没法填补它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never fill it, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我选择向前看 忘记过往\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I chose to look forward, not backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我这样做了之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the minute I did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.47,0:17:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝让这个美丽热情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The powers that be brought this beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.80,0:17:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人走进了我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compassionate, amazing woman into my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对待Bess如同自己亲生女儿般\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she helped me raise a little babygirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,养育她长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if Bess were her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.82,0:17:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能霸占所有功劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't take all the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸也有帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy had a hand in it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.81,0:17:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他发现了你的潜能\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saw your potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲 愿他安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father, bless his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他以前是我们教堂的教士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the previous reverend of our church.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们家族第三代\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third generation in our family to serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:18:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们是第四代\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are the forth-generation werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.67,0:18:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,教士Jim\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the good reverend Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his family are all a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有点老派和落伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}New-agey and hippie-dippie like.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们很真诚友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they are clean as whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们小区的支柱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pillars of our community.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么FBI会对他们感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is the FBI even interested in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是跟踪线索罢了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just go where they send me, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.84,0:18:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我更感兴趣的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth be told, I'm more interested in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀或者X档案之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murders and X-files-y stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.84,0:18:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这附近有什么不寻常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything of that variety around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了 先生 我们这是个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sir, we are just a small town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有什么犯罪可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much crime to any to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 真希望我能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, agent, I wish I could be more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想起什么其他的 就给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you do think of something, give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没吃饱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我只是 看看你们有没有啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was just…seeing if you had any beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你明白这里其实一切都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner you realize that all is good here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.98,0:19:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩没有咬咬玩具什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you two have a chew toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以玩的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or something to go play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.91,0:19:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我单独和Dean说两句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I grap a second with Dean here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么为难我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you being so hard on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.85,0:19:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这里的一切绝不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because there is no way that all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.69,0:19:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如表面这么简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is what it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.71,0:19:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 老兄 我知道你一定是喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on man, I know you drank the kool-aid, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}But come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.51,0:19:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这一切都很疯狂 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is all looks nuts, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.48,0:19:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱和家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love and a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.53,0:19:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会去在意那些是从何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares where that comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚来这里的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能够释怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't let go either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直等待着更坏的情况发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept waiting for the other shoe to drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那并没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.69,0:19:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我学着接受真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to accept the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.89,0:20:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我告诉你另一个真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got another truth for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.54,0:20:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你擅离职守期间 我们完全找不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all left in the dark when you went AWOL.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.53,0:20:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不知道你是死了还是遭遇更惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know whether you were dead or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该跟我们联系 发个信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've reached out and sent someone a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}And said what, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.15,0:20:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我是个狼人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.64,0:20:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法启齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我躲得远远的 对大家都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it's best for everyone if I just stayed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但并不意味着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that doesn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.84,0:20:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想念你和Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think about and miss you and Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他永远离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.52,0:20:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.36,0:20:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他需要我的时候 我没有在他身边 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he needed me, I wasn't there.That's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 Dean，他们给了你午饭和派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Dean, they gave you lunch and pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.09,0:21:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么我们还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.37,0:21:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.56,0:21:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Garth's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要先离开的话 我完全同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hit the road, it's square by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.11,0:21:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是说 这不是我们第一次遇到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm just saying, this wouldn't be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,友善的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came across a friendly monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是友善的怪物家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a family of friendly monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.52,0:21:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管是什么都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是Perry探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Perry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff, how can I help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要奇怪的发现 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wanted weird, agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.96,0:21:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我是什么杀了这头鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me what torn up that deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一片已经没什么动物经过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing that runs in these this parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,血液是新鲜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fresh blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.93,0:22:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有温度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.69,0:22:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这头鹿是我们接到电话以后才被杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means it died after we got the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就不能承认这里是一切正常 然后离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't just accept all was good and move on, could you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.07,0:22:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本不知道自己卷进了什么里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what you've walked into, do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 你们不会活着离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter, you won't be walking out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.08,0:23:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是好人教士家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that is favourite accessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,最喜欢的饰品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of good reverend and his floke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.90,0:23:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神的黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ragnarok.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.04,0:23:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是Thor Loki还有Odin之类的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Thor, Loki and Odin stuff, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.12,0:23:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 是古老的北欧神话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's Norse mythology's end of days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会刻在子弹上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it etched onto a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎 我们需要的答案找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares, we got all the answers we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.25,0:23:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚 Dean 我想我们还需要更多线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean, I think we need more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 这个警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, what?Sheriff Andy Taylor here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't good enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.76,0:23:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够杀死Garth吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to kill Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 老兄 我们要好好解决这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on man, let's do this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 把这里清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, fine.Clean these up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.65,0:23:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把Garth抓起来锁好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab Garth and lock him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们找到真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Untill we figure out what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.56,0:23:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看看那个教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go check out that church.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.04,0:24:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.68,0:25:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.14,0:25:38.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（诸神的黄昏）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.47,0:25:44.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯堪的纳维亚神话传说 世界末日）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.07,0:25:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到那对爱情鸟了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find the lovebirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.07,0:25:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.27,0:25:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里乱七八糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The place is a wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.90,0:25:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到Garth 也没看到Bess\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Garth, no Bess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.50,0:25:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们被抓走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, they were taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.17,0:25:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下他妈的好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fan-friggin'-tastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.07,0:26:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你查到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.43,0:26:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个叫诸神的黄昏 世界末日的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a Ragnarok, end of the days, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.89,0:26:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,故事从一个叫做Fenris的巨狼开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start the story with a wolf named Fenris.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.74,0:26:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在世界末日之前杀了Odin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who kills the God Odin before the world ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.93,0:26:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 知道这个有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, and that helps us how.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.37,0:26:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些邪教组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are cults that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.29,0:26:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,将Fenris视作巨狼之神来崇拜他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider Fenris a wolf deity and worship him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.35,0:26:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将自己称作Fenris之腹\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call themselves the Maw of Fenris.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.65,0:26:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,信仰狼人的邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cult to werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.85,0:26:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.51,0:26:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神的黄昏不只是个圣经故事而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Ragnarok is not just a Bible story, these nutjobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.57,0:26:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是个蓄谋已久的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an action plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,灭绝人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯粹彻底的狼人统治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Total and complete werewolf domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.95,0:26:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 这里就是一切开始的地方吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, what, this is the ground zero for the movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.41,0:26:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的威斯康辛州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freakin' Wisconsin, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.19,0:26:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jim神父该下台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's the time for reverend Jim to go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.45,0:26:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.49,0:26:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要帮忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.20,0:26:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我搞的定\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.14,0:26:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找到Garth就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just you find Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.98,0:26:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.18,0:27:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别躲着了 Dean 我听得到你的心跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no use, Dean.I can hear your heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.89,0:27:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样做有无数次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have done this countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.82,0:27:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你还是会紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you still get nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.14,0:27:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有恐惧的话 怎么能叫做人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing wrong with a little fear.It's what makes us human.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧并不是人类的专利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear is not a purely human instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.11,0:27:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物们也会感到恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even monsters know fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.22,0:27:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来准备我的布道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to work on my sermon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.84,0:27:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先给我讲讲Fenris之腹是怎么回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you start by preaching to me about the Maw of Fenris.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.16,0:27:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.93,0:27:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经知道你和你族群的计划了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about you and your pack's little plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 我们没有什么计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, we are planning nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.60,0:27:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那为什么我在你的经书里读到了这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?Then why did I read about it in your good book.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.96,0:28:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为几十年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because generations ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.60,0:28:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,仇恨和错误的愤懑是我们信仰的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hate and misplaced anger was part of our beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.87,0:28:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是自从我接手这个之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ever since I took over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.18,0:28:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这部分从我们教会中彻底根除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have eradicated it from our congregation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.19,0:28:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显他们中间有些人没听到你的教导\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently some of them didn't get the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.02,0:28:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the good sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.65,0:28:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,想杀死我和我弟弟的好人警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who just tried to off me and my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pat警长吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sheriff Pat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.70,0:28:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.91,0:28:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.78,0:28:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is what.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.46,0:28:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神的黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ragnarok.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.33,0:28:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.02,0:28:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长的子弹里就嵌着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was etched into the sheriff's bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.22,0:28:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能 那一族的人已经都死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impossible.The Maw is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.63,0:28:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎么解释Garth还有你女儿的失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell that to Garth and your daughter who are missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.45,0:28:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.59,0:28:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bess\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.48,0:29:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.71,0:29:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you two doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.73,0:29:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Russ Joba\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russ, Joba.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.11,0:29:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, what is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.29,0:29:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我不是你老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}First of all, I'm not your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.69,0:29:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别碰她 听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leave her alone.You hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.15,0:29:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想折磨谁的话 就折磨我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to hurt somebody, you hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.81,0:29:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真甜蜜啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.19,0:29:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我就是想折磨他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am going to hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.78,0:29:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.50,0:29:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But especially you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.91,0:29:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你把这些猎人引到了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For bringing these hunters here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.37,0:29:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要折磨你们所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna hurt all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.58,0:29:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.02,0:29:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sam 接电话啊 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, pick up, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.65,0:30:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.91,0:30:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别伤害Bess 她是你女儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to Bess, she's your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.98,0:30:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底得强调多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.16,0:30:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,继女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.19,0:30:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是我们这一族的最后一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the last of my bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.36,0:30:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你和你那些同族们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to you and your kind out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.98,0:30:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.92,0:30:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是秀色可餐啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you just look good enough to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.53,0:30:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.44,0:30:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以理解你想伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, me, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.02,0:30:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这些人是你的家人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these people are your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.84,0:31:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的族群\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.23,0:31:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年冬天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.41,0:31:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的弟弟Charlie 被一个猎人杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My little brother Charlie was killed by a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的丈夫还劝我要有耐心 要隐忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband counseled patience, restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.54,0:31:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他偷走我们神圣的教堂时一个嘴脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as when he took over our beloved church.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.64,0:31:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他指引人们走向新的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}He preached a new direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.65,0:31:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼人和人类和平共处的道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lycanthropes and men would co-exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.73,0:31:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为和平比统治更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace was more important than dominance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.75,0:31:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想法设法地帮助他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tried so hard to make his way work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.59,0:31:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力做一个传教士的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be a preacher's wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.23,0:31:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但接着 Charlie被杀死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, Charlie was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.72,0:31:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我不由自主地想到我父亲的布道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't help remembering my daddy's sermons.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.57,0:31:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看来他说的才是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by golly turns out he was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.56,0:32:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要有人类存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as there's a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.12,0:32:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界就永无和平之日\N{\fnArial\fs30}There can be no peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.61,0:32:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为人类只会毁坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because man destroys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.99,0:32:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.65,0:32:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我厌倦这一切了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.66,0:32:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在算明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.65,0:32:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然力量如此强大 为什么还要与人类共存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why co-exist, when you can rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.78,0:32:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,答对了 但是我丈夫并不是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo, but my husband doesn't see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.18,0:32:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是被咬了才成为狼人 不像我是天生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, he's bitten, not born into it, like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.32,0:32:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他仍然保留有一点人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still holds on to his humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.53,0:32:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是为什么我很乐意看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I'm so pleased that it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.59,0:32:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他挑起了诸神的黄昏 而不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}His claws that start Ragnarok, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.81,0:32:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你哥哥来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your brother coming here was.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.21,0:33:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就是Fenris的显灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A blessing from Fenris above.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩把Garth逼得走投无路\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two of you cornered Garth here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.81,0:33:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后当Bess闯进来想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then when Bess came running in to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.84,0:33:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到底在搞什么鬼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuss was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.96,0:33:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你残忍的杀害了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.26,0:33:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.20,0:33:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就死在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.27,0:33:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,银弹穿心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silver to the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.91,0:33:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想拉我做替罪羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna frame their murders on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.49,0:33:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫确实曾对猎人忍气吞声\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband turned his cheek once.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.61,0:33:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次我不这么认为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.47,0:33:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,离她远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, get away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.52,0:33:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死你我并不感到快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing you gives me no joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.69,0:33:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神的黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Ragnarok.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.52,0:33:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,才是重中之重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bigger than all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.42,0:33:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.07,0:33:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是存心想让我的爪子沾满鲜血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just dying for me to get my claws dirty, aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.98,0:34:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着Russ的衣服掩盖掉你的气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wearing Russ's coat to hide your scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.25,0:34:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.58,0:34:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是能让人大吃一惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.94,0:34:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}As am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.43,0:34:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好做人 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good, you hear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.14,0:34:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 谢谢 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.Thanks, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.50,0:34:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.82,0:35:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking it pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.58,0:35:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得自己应该早点儿发现事情不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like he should've seen the signs earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.44,0:35:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, maybe you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.29,0:35:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems like a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.31,0:35:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这件事而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.75,0:35:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你也是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.And you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.79,0:35:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里并不是那么完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything around here wasn't copacetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.05,0:35:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screwed up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.82,0:35:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先是Kevin 然后这事 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- First Kevin, now this. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.34,0:35:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin的事归咎于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, that's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.66,0:35:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把他拉进这个圈子里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who pulled him into all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.74,0:35:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是那个应该好好保护他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one who should've been there to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.82,0:35:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要为自己的错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, guess there's enough of that blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.40,0:35:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,承担责任嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.61,0:35:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Dean - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.37,0:35:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来有点疯狂 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this may sound a little crazy, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.52,0:35:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我可以回去然后跟你一起猎魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I could come back and hunt with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.54,0:35:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我狼人的力量 我们是有优势的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, with my werewolf mojo, we'd have an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.63,0:35:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 Garth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Garth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.82,0:35:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我想要弥补这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I want to make this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本不应该离开你们的 尤其是Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should've left you guys, especially Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.43,0:36:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.24,0:36:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而朋友间是不会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.17,0:36:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, you said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.68,0:36:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在乎幸福是从何而来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, who cares where happiness comes from.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.21,0:36:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有点奇怪 有点神经质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're all little weird, we're all little wacky.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.79,0:36:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比其他人怪得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some more than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.33,0:36:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果那样行得通 就那样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if it works, it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.33,0:36:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这里还有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.59,0:36:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使他们是狼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?Even though they are werewolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.12,0:36:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是狼化人什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lycanthropes, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.93,0:36:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要放手 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let that go, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.84,0:36:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你永远都不会原谅自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you'll never forgive yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.21,0:36:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 你还得快快乐乐地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides somebody's got to live to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.92,0:36:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活下去 不能让这件事情就这么石沉大海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell this damn story someday and who better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.99,0:36:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧闭嘴 过来给我抱一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now shut up and come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.54,0:36:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 - 快点 在我改变主意之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Hurry up, before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.70,0:37:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会寄明信片给你的 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll send you that postcard. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.66,0:37:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.58,0:37:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 那天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, that night that, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.22,0:37:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是咱们决定分头行动那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we went our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.19,0:37:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说我们分道扬镳那天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean that you and I split.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.78,0:37:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样说也没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.16,0:37:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我状态很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was messed-up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.85,0:37:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kevin死了 而我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin was dead, and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.34,0:38:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道我是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.04,0:38:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.48,0:38:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我现在也还没缓过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, maybe I still don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.61,0:38:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 我也知道我对你态度不是特别好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, um, I know I took a piece of you in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.49,0:38:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.43,0:38:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像有人改变了剧本 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody changed the playbook, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.15,0:38:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像对的事情其实是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like what's right is wrong, and.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.74,0:38:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,错的事情更错\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong is more wrong, and.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.12,0:38:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道当\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know that when.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.89,0:38:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们一起行动的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we rode together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况只会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We split the crappiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.06,0:38:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.07,0:38:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.05,0:39:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.13,0:39:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dean 我们之间已经出现问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But something is broken here, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.79,0:39:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说没有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying is not, I.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.86,0:39:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是觉得如果有时间我们可以一起喝一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we need to put a couple W's on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.15,0:39:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定就能和好如初什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we get past all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.36,0:39:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.14,0:39:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我希望是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.35,0:39:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对事情的看法不再一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't see things in the same way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.96,0:39:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看待事物的角度也不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our roles in this whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.55,0:39:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次在教堂里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back in that church.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.06,0:39:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,说服我把地狱封起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking me out of boarding up hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.84,0:39:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是耍伎俩让Gadreel附我的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or tricking me into letting Gadreel possess me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.47,0:39:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法再相信你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.47,0:39:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能像以前那样给予你信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the way I thought I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.35,0:39:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能像我应该做的那样无话不谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the way I should be able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.29,0:39:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 不管发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, whatever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.55,0:39:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是一家人 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're family, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.51,0:39:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得好像这句话是万灵药一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like it's some sort of cure-all.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.84,0:40:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像它能够改变事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it can change the fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.69,0:40:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间会变成这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That everything, that have ever gone wrong between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.14,0:40:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为我们是一家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has been because we're family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.36,0:40:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们 不再是一家人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, we're not family now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.84,0:40:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 如果你想要一起工作的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying, you wanna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.04,0:40:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.36,0:40:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你想要成为兄弟的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to be brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.09,0:40:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,该说的我都说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those're my terms.
